  "post_content": "<p>La persona que posea el n&ordm; 30 es la ganadora del bal&oacute;n del Bar&ccedil;a de la Champions 2015, firmado por todos sus jugadores y donado por la comisi&oacute;n de fiestas de Alcudia de Veo, a beneficio de la Asociaci&oacute;n Castell&oacute;n contra el C&aacute;ncer (ACCC) en Onda.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/04/IMG_8120.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El sorteo se ha celebrado la noche de este domingo en la Penya Barcelonista, durante el descanso del cl&aacute;sico Real Madrid-FC Barcelona.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigbalobarcaaccc/img_8096.jpg\" alt=\"img_8096\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigbalobarcaaccc/img_8097.jpg\" alt=\"img_8097\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigbalobarcaaccc/img_8098.jpg\" alt=\"img_8098\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigbalobarcaaccc/img_8099.jpg\" alt=\"img_8099\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigbalobarcaaccc/img_8100.jpg\" alt=\"img_8100\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigbalobarcaaccc/img_8101.jpg\" alt=\"img_8101\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigbalobarcaaccc/img_8102.jpg\" alt=\"img_8102\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigbalobarcaaccc/img_8103.jpg\" alt=\"img_8103\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439ef